=2 Walkthrough
* Examine the **Transcendental Radiance** once more to commence the {M:No Time Like the Future|No Time Like the Future|No Time like the Future} battle.
** If you lose the fight, obtain another {@k} {k:Cait Sith's whisker} from {p:Cait Sith} outside of the BCNM.

=2 Battle
You will fight {n:Sempurne}.
* Sempurne itself is a "weakened" version of {m:Shinryu} from **Abyssea - {p:Empyreal Paradox}**.
* Sempurne uses all of {m:Shinryu}'s abilities __without__ the added ability to recover HP from taking damage while readying TP moves or Casting Magic.
* Easily soloable with Trusts as an iLvl DD Job.

=2 Directions to Sempurne
* Here's how to get to Sempurne. This is useful if you are not in the middle of the Quest line and are only coming to learn {s:Mighty Guard} or help another player.
* Proceed to a {p:Cavernous Maw}.
** The {z:Batallia Downs} Maw at (H-5) is the most accessible as it is right next to the {p:Survival Guide}.
*** Otherwise, the maw in {z:Rolanberry Fields} at (H-6) (also next to a {p:Survival Guide}) is a quick {p:Mount} ride from the {z:Lower Jeuno} {p:Home Point} #1 (E).
* Click the blue **???** right next to the {p:Cavernous Maw}.
* This will zone you into {p:Walk of Echoes}. You should be looking at the big purple staircase with only one purple lava lamp behind you. At no point in this journey should you go up the big staircase.
* Run slightly forward and to the right (north-east) to the white **???** and click it.
* This will zone you into {p:Desuetia - Empyreal Paradox}.
* Run straight ahead, and click on **Transcendental Radiance** to enter the Sempurne fight.

